msgid ""
"***WARNING: Responding to this message will reveal your username to the gildee.***\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"***KONTUZ: Mezu honi erantzuteak zure erabiltzaile-izena agerian utziko dio urrea jaso duenari.***\n"
"\n"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:137
msgid ""
"Thanks for claiming a tippr gold code.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Eskerrik asko tippr urre-kode bat hartzeagatik.\n"
"\n"

#: r2/lib/strings.py:138
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **monthly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each month until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional months of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"Zuretzat (%(user)s) tippr urre-harpidetza iraunkor eta automatikoki berritzen den bat sortzera zoaz. \n"
"\n"
"**%(price)s** ordainduko duzu horregatik, **hilero**. \n"
"\n"
">Harpidetza hau hilero automatikoki berrituko da bertan behera uzten duzun arte. Edozein unetan utz dezakezu bertan behera. Bertan behera uzten baduzu, ez zaizu zerbitzuaren hilabete gehiagorik kobratuko, eta zerbitzuak fakturazio-aldiaren amaierara arte jarraituko du. Bertan behera uzten baduzu, ez zaizu dagoeneko ordaindutako zerbitzuaren dirurik itzuliko. Ordainagiriak mezu pribatu bidez bidaliko dira zure kontura."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:139
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're about to set up an ongoing, autorenewing subscription to tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). \n"
"\n"
"You'll pay **%(price)s** for this, **yearly**. \n"
"\n"
">This subscription will renew automatically each year until you cancel. You may cancel at any time. If you cancel, you will not be billed for any additional years of service, and service will continue until the end of the billing period. If you cancel, you will not receive a refund for any service already paid for. Receipts will be delivered via private message in your account."
msgstr ""
"Zuretzat (%(user)s) tippr urre-harpidetza iraunkor eta automatikoki berritzen den bat sortzera zoaz. \n"
"\n"
"**%(price)s** ordainduko duzu horregatik, **urtero**. \n"
"\n"
">Harpidetza hau urtero automatikoki berrituko da bertan behera uzten duzun arte. Edozein unetan utz dezakezu bertan behera. Bertan behera uzten baduzu, ez zaizu zerbitzuaren urte gehiagorik kobratuko, eta zerbitzuak fakturazio-aldiaren amaierara arte jarraituko du. Bertan behera uzten baduzu, ez zaizu dagoeneko ordaindutako zerbitzuaren dirurik itzuliko. Ordainagiriak mezu pribatu bidez bidaliko dira zure kontura."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:140
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to make a one-time purchase of %(amount)s of tippr gold for yourself (%(user)s). You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "Zuretzat (%(user)s) %(amount)s tippr urreko erosketa bakarra egitera zoaz. Guztira %(price)s ordainduko duzu."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:141
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to purchase %(amount)s for Give Gold. It works like a gift certificate: each month of it gives someone one month of tippr gold. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "'Eman urrea'-rako %(amount)s erostera zoaz. Opari-txartel baten antzera dabil: haren hilabete bakoitzak norbaiti tippr urreko hilabete bat ematen dio. Guztira %(price)s ordainduko duzu."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:142
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to purchase %(amount)s of tippr gold in the form of a gift code. The recipient (or you) will be able to claim the code to redeem that gold to their account. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "%(amount)s tippr urre erostera zoaz opari-kode moduan. Hartzaileak (edo zuk) kodea erabili ahal izango du urre hori bere kontura eramateko. Guztira %(price)s ordainduko duzu."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:143
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to give %(amount)s of tippr gold to %(recipient)s, who will be told that it came from you. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "%(amount)s tippr urre ematera zoaz %(recipient)s-ri, eta zuk eman diozula esango zaio. Guztira %(price)s ordainduko duzu."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:144
#, python-format
msgid "You're about to give %(amount)s of tippr gold to %(recipient)s. It will be an anonymous gift. You'll pay a total of %(price)s for this."
msgstr "%(amount)s tippr urre ematera zoaz %(recipient)s-ri. Opari anonimoa izango da. Guztira %(price)s ordainduko duzu."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:145
#, python-format
msgid "Want to say thanks to *%(recipient)s* for this comment? Give them a month of [tippr gold](/gold/about)."
msgstr "Eskerrak eman nahi dizkiozu *%(recipient)s*-ri iruzkin honengatik? Eman iezaiozu [tippr urreko](/gold/about) hilabete bat."

#: r2/lib/strings.py:146
#, python-format
msgid "Want to say thanks to *%(recipient)s* for this submission? Give them a month of [tippr gold](/gold/about)."
msgstr "Eskerrak eman nahi dizkiozu *%(recipient)s*-ri bidalketa honengatik? Eman iezaiozu [tippr urreko](/gold/about) hilabete bat."

