#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:36 r2/lib/system_messages.py:76
msgid "Welcome! You are now a moderator"
msgstr "Ongi etorri! Moderatzailea zara orain"

#: r2/lib/system_messages.py:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Congratulations!** You have been added as a moderator to [%(title)s](%(url)s).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Welcome to the Tippr Moderator Community!\n"
"\n"
"As a moderator, you play a vital role in building and maintaining our community. Here are some important things to know:\n"
"\n"
"### Your Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Enforce vault rules and site-wide policies\n"
"- Foster a welcoming environment for community members\n"
"- Review reports and take appropriate action\n"
"- Collaborate with fellow moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Important Resources\n"
"\n"
"- [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Learn about best practices and expectations\n"
"- [Content Policy](/help/contentpolicy) - Understand site-wide rules\n"
"- [User Agreement](/help/useragreement) - Know the terms of service\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Connect with other moderators\n"
"\n"
"### Volunteer Status\n"
"\n"
"Please note that moderators are independent volunteers, not employees of Tippr. For more details, please review the [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for helping make Tippr a great place!"
msgstr ""
"**Zorionak!** [%(title)s](%(url)s)-ko moderatzaile gisa gehitu zaituzte.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Ongi etorri Tippr-en moderatzaileen komunitatera!\n"
"\n"
"Moderatzaile gisa, zeregin garrantzitsua duzu gure komunitatea eraiki eta zaintzeko. Hona hemen jakin beharreko gauza garrantzitsu batzuk:\n"
"\n"
"### Zure ardurak\n"
"\n"
"- Bete arazi vaultaren arauak eta gune osoko politikak\n"
"- Komunitateko kideentzat giro abegitsua sustatu\n"
"- Berrikusi salaketak eta hartu neurri egokiak\n"
"- Lankidetzan aritu beste moderatzaileekin\n"
"\n"
"### Baliabide garrantzitsuak\n"
"\n"
"- [Moderatzaileentzako jarraibideak](/help/moderatorguidelines) - Ikasi jardunbide egokiei eta itxaropenei buruz\n"
"- [Edukien politika](/help/contentpolicy) - Ulertu gune osoko arauak\n"
"- [Erabiltzaile-hitzarmena](/help/useragreement) - Ezagutu zerbitzu-baldintzak\n"
"- [/v/ModSupport](/v/ModSupport) - Jarri harremanetan beste moderatzaileekin\n"
"\n"
"### Boluntario-egoera\n"
"\n"
"Kontuan izan moderatzaileak boluntario independenteak direla, ez Tippr-en langileak. Xehetasun gehiagorako, irakurri [Moderatzaileentzako jarraibideak](/help/moderatorguidelines).\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"Eskerrik asko Tippr leku bikaina izaten laguntzeagatik!"

