#: r2/templates/adminantispam.html:74
msgid "CleanTalk"
msgstr "CleanTalk"

#: r2/templates/adminantispam.html:76
msgid "CleanTalk (cleantalk.org, a paid service) checks sign-ups, posts, comments and messages without asking anything of people. Spam sign-ups are refused; spam posts, comments and messages are saved but hidden as spam, for moderators to review in their spam queue. If CleanTalk can't be reached, everything goes through."
msgstr "CleanTalk-ek (cleantalk.org, ordainpeko zerbitzua) izen-emateak, argitalpenak, iruzkinak eta mezuak egiaztatzen ditu jendeari ezer eskatu gabe. Spam izen-emateak baztertu egiten dira; spam argitalpen, iruzkin eta mezuak gorde egiten dira baina spam gisa ezkutatuta, moderatzaileek beren spam-ilaran berrikus ditzaten. CleanTalk-era iritsi ezin bada, dena onartzen da."

