#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:107
msgid "The site counts its own traffic for the traffic pages (/traffic, and each vault's traffic stats) without any outside service. To use Google Analytics as well, paste its measurement ID (G-…, or the whole tag Google gives you). It isn't loaded for visitors whose browser asks not to be tracked. In some places (the EU and UK, for example) you need visitors' consent before using it; the privacy policy already says the site may use analytics."
msgstr "Guneak bere trafikoa zenbatzen du trafiko-orrietarako (/traffic, eta vault bakoitzaren trafiko-estatistikak) kanpoko zerbitzurik gabe. Google Analytics ere erabiltzeko, itsatsi bere neurketa-IDa (G-…, edo Googlek ematen dizun etiketa osoa). Ez da kargatzen jarraipena ez egiteko eskatzen duen nabigatzailea duten bisitarientzat. Leku batzuetan (EBn eta Erresuma Batuan, adibidez) bisitarien baimena behar duzu erabili aurretik; pribatutasun-politikak dagoeneko dio guneak analitika erabil dezakeela."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:109
msgid "Google Analytics"
msgstr "Google Analytics"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:109
msgid "The measurement ID, e.g. G-ABC123XYZ. Blank: no Google Analytics."
msgstr "Neurketa-IDa, adib. G-ABC123XYZ. Hutsik: Google Analyticsik ez."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:111
msgid "visitors' consent"
msgstr "bisitarien baimena"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:113
msgid "ask first"
msgstr "galdetu lehenik"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:114
msgid "don't ask"
msgstr "ez galdetu"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:115
msgid "Ask first: a banner asks each visitor, and Google Analytics loads only for those who allow it. Their answer is kept in their browser, and with their account when they're signed in (they can change it in their preferences). Don't ask: it loads for everyone, which is only allowed where consent isn't required."
msgstr "Galdetu lehenik: banner batek bisitari bakoitzari galdetzen dio, eta Google Analytics baimena ematen dutenentzat soilik kargatzen da. Haien erantzuna nabigatzailean gordetzen da, eta beren kontuarekin saioa hasita dutenean (hobespenetan alda dezakete). Ez galdetu: guztientzat kargatzen da, eta hori baimena behar ez den lekuetan soilik dago onartuta."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:120
msgid "announcement"
msgstr "iragarpena"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:122
msgid "banner text"
msgstr "bannerraren testua"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:122
msgid "Shown at the top of every page until someone closes it; it comes back for everyone when you change it. Blank: no banner."
msgstr "Orri guztien goialdean erakusten da norbaitek itxi arte; aldatzen duzunean guztientzat agertzen da berriro. Hutsik: bannerrik ez."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:123
msgid "banner link"
msgstr "bannerraren esteka"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:123
msgid "Optional: where the banner leads, e.g. a post about the change (https://... or /v/...)."
msgstr "Aukerakoa: bannerrak nora eramaten duen, adib. aldaketari buruzko argitalpen bat (https://... edo /v/...)."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:126
msgid "new accounts"
msgstr "kontu berriak"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:133
msgid "Closed: the sign-up form is replaced by a notice and new accounts are refused. Existing accounts can still log in."
msgstr "Itxita: izena emateko inprimakiaren ordez ohar bat agertzen da eta kontu berriak baztertzen dira. Lehendik dauden kontuek saioa has dezakete oraindik."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:138
msgid "policy pages"
msgstr "politika-orriak"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:139
msgid "The user agreement, privacy policy, content policy and moderator guidelines start from the templates in docs/policies, filled in with the site name, domain and these two; where they say how to reach you, they link to sections of the contact page (/contact), which offers a message to the admins and the contact address above when it is set. They're wiki pages: edit them at /wiki/useragreement and so on. To rebuild them from the templates after changing these (this replaces any edits):"
msgstr "Erabiltzaile-hitzarmena, pribatutasun-politika, eduki-politika eta moderatzaileentzako jarraibideak docs/policies-eko txantiloietatik abiatzen dira, gunearen izenarekin, domeinuarekin eta bi hauekin beteta; zurekin harremanetan jartzeko modua azaltzen duten lekuetan, harremanetarako orriko (/contact) ataletara estekatzen dute, administratzaileei mezu bat bidaltzeko aukera eta goiko harremanetarako helbidea (ezarrita badago) eskaintzen dituena. Wiki-orriak dira: editatu /wiki/useragreement orrian eta abar. Hauek aldatu ondoren txantiloietatik berreraikitzeko (honek edizio guztiak ordezten ditu):"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:142
msgid "operator"
msgstr "operadorea"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:142
msgid "Who runs the site, by legal name (a company, or your own name). Blank: the site name."
msgstr "Gunea nork kudeatzen duen, izen legalez (enpresa bat, edo zure izena). Hutsik: gunearen izena."

