msgstr "Politikak zein legeren menpe dauden, adib. \"New Yorkeko Estatua\" edo \"Ingalaterra eta Gales\". Hutsik: operadorea ezarrita dagoen lekukoa."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:150 r2/templates/vaultstylesheet.html:120 r2/templates/vaultstylesheetsource.html:46
msgid "images"
msgstr "irudiak"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:151
msgid "Each image is saved on its own as soon as you choose it (the save button above is only for the settings above it). Uploading one replaces the last."
msgstr "Irudi bakoitza bere aldetik gordetzen da aukeratu bezain laster (goiko gorde botoia haren gaineko ezarpenetarako soilik da). Bat igotzeak aurrekoa ordezten du."

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:153
msgid "logo"
msgstr "logotipoa"

#: r2/templates/adminsitesettings.html:153
msgid "Shown at most 48 pixels high in the header; a transparent background works best. Vaults with their own header image show that instead."
